---
const concepts = [
  {
    name: 'Discobox',
    tag: 'the box',
    body:
      'A disposable environment with your source already in it. Every discobox has one default terminal — the harness, or a shell — and its own git remote, so work leaves as commits rather than as a diff you have to trust.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Pool',
    tag: 'the floor',
    body:
      'The host discoboxes are scheduled onto and the boundary they share. Boxes in a pool share a cache volume, a resource envelope, and a kernel: on Linux a local pool is a libkrun microVM, on macOS a Virtualization.framework VM.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Harness',
    tag: 'the act',
    body:
      'The agent a discobox runs. Claude Code and Codex ship built in, and because a harness is just an image carrying a label, any terminal coding agent you can install becomes one. Configure it once and every box gets it; the built-in shell is a harness too.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="concepts">
  <div class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Concepts</p>
    <h2 class="section__title">Three primitives, and no fourth.</h2>

    <div class="concepts">
      {
        concepts.map((concept, index) => (
          <div class="card concept">
            <span class="concept__index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3 class="concept__name">{concept.name}</h3>
            <p class="concept__tag">{concept.tag}</p>
            <p class="concept__body">{concept.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .concepts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  @media (min-width: 54rem) {
    .concepts {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .concept__index {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .concept__name {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .concept__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--magenta);
  }

  .concept__body {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
